{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00707","headline":"郊庙歌辞 仪坤庙乐章 雍和 · 员半千","name":"郊庙歌辞 仪坤庙乐章 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孝享云毕，惟彻有章。\n云感玄羽，风凄素商。\n瞻望神座，祗恋匪遑。\n礼终乐阕，肃雍锵锵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"员半千","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}